The library covers the request side but nothing on the receiving side. paypal-integration makes webhooks the authoritative source of payment state, so every consumer currently hand-rolls verification. Missing: POST /v1/notifications/verify-webhook-signature, a helper that takes the raw body + headers + webhook_id, and the webhook CRUD operations (create/list/delete). Raw body must stay raw -- re-serialised JSON breaks the signature.

